cles) and stable voltage</li><li>Built-in BMS (Battery Management System) for overcharge, over-discharge, overcurrent, short-circuit, and temperature protection</li><li>Parallel Expandable up to multiple units for scalable energy storage</li><li>Safe &amp; Maintenance-Free design</li><li>Compact &amp; Lightweight for easy installation</li><li>Supports Solar Systems, UPS, Telecom, and Industrial Applications</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Marsriva MR-LFP24-100-WMD 25.6V 102Ah BYD Cell LiFePO4 Battery","href":"/marsriva-mr-lfp24-100-wmd-256v-102ah-byd-cell-lifepo4-battery","now":"77,000৳","old":"78,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must LP16-24100 25.6V 100Ah UPS Battery","href":"/must-lp16-24100-256v-100ah-ups-battery","now":"74,000৳","old":"76,000৳","single":""},{"name":"MR-LBP12-100-LAR 12V 100Ah LiFePO4 Battery","href":"/mr-lbp12-100-lar-12v-100ah-lifepo4-battery","now":"","old":"","single":"30,000৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf1200-1200va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF1200/MR-UF1200-500x-(2)-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Marsiva MR-UF1200 1200VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Marsiva MR-UF1200 1200VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","now":"","old":"","single":"7,900৳","tax":"Ex Tax:7,900৳","out":true},{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf2000-2000va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF800/UF2000-500x(2)-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Marsiva MR-UF2000 2000VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Marsiva MR-UF2000 2000VA Smart Line-Interactive UPS","now":"","old":"","single":"15,500৳","tax":"Ex Tax:15,500৳","out":fals